\pard\b\fs20 Idol of Magic\b0\par
\fs16\par
It is an old custom of the magicians. Whenever a Clonk wants to become a magician, he has to build a magical statue as thanks to his master. But it isn't all that easy, because the young magician needs many objects that are not always easy to get.\par
